<section
  id="inicio"
  class="z-0 bg-attachment-fixed relative flex justify-center items-center bg-[url('/images/dentalOfficeBG.webp')] bg-blue-900 bg-cover bg-no-repeat bg-center min-h-[calc(100vh-5rem)]"
>
  <div
    class="top-0 left-0 absolute flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-4 lg:gap-6 bg-blue-950/80 lg:p-8 px-6 py-12 w-full h-full text-white text-center"
  >
    <h1 class="w-full lg:w-2/3 font-bold text-4xl lg:-mt-8 lg:text-7xl leading-tight">
      Tu sonrisa perfecta, <span
        class="bg-clip-text bg-linear-to-r from-blue-400 to-blue-600 text-transparent"
        >diseñada por expertos</span
      >
    </h1>

    <p
      class="w-full lg:w-2/3 text-slate-100 text-base lg:text-2xl leading-relaxed"
    >
      Ofrecemos cuidado dental de vanguardia en un ambiente moderno y
      confortable. Confía en nosotros para lograr la salud bucal que mereces.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 lg:gap-6 mb-6 lg:mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg
          class="size-8 text-blue-300"
          fill="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 20 20"
        >
          <path
            fill-rule="evenodd"
            d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
            clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
        </svg>
        <span class="text-sm lg:text-lg">Tecnología de última generación</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg
          class="size-8 text-blue-300"
          fill="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 20 20"
        >
          <path
            fill-rule="evenodd"
            d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
            clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
        </svg>
        <span class="text-sm lg:text-lg">Atención personalizada</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg
          class="size-8 text-blue-300"
          fill="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 20 20"
        >
          <path
            fill-rule="evenodd"
            d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
            clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
        </svg>
        <span class="text-sm lg:text-lg">Excelencia en odontología</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex lg:flex-row flex-col gap-4 mt-4">
      <a
        href="#solicitar-cita"
        class="group inline-block relative bg-linear-to-r from-blue-500 hover:from-blue-600 to-blue-600 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold text-white transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300"
      >
        <span class="relative flex items-center gap-2 lg:text-2xl">
          Reserva una cita
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="5"
              d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </a>

      <a
        href="#servicios"
        class="group inline-block relative content-center hover:bg-white px-8 py-3 border-2 border-white rounded-lg font-semibold text-white hover:text-blue-950 lg:text-xl transition-all duration-300"
